* One iteration of the fold mover: the popped letter is pushed on stack ` J ` and folded into the internal state, whose class is therefore a function of the word accumulated so far --- ` { q e. ( 2nd ` T ) | ( P' ` q ) = ( O ` s ) } ` with ` O ` the fold and ` P' ` the field it acts on.  Lean: ` zeroScan_loop ` , the ` cons ` case (` flag := flag && !bit `).  At a constant ` O ` this is ~ tm2fmvn1 .

